  "term": "agreeableness",
  "definition": "Agreeableness is a personality trait describing how naturally or easily a person acts in an agreeable way. In this packet, higher trait agreeableness is linked with feeling better and less stressed after behaving agreeably, suggesting that agreeable behavior may feel easier or more rewarding for those higher in this trait.",
